  {
   "text": "Viktor Halvorsen is now registered as patient ID 4, with DOB 1971-12-30.\n\nThe first attempt ended on a \"Service Unavailable\" page, and a search afterward found no Halvorsen record. I filled the form in again and submitted it, and the second attempt created the patient. I didn't open the Contact tab afterward, so the saved address, phone and email are unchecked. They were all correct on the form before I submitted it.\n\n- **Sex:** I set both \"Birth Sex\" (a required field) and \"Sex\" to Male, since the form has both.\n- **Address:** The form displayed the street and city in capitals (99 BROOK STREET, SPRINGFIELD). I typed them in normal case, so that is how the form shows them.\n- **Pop-up:** At the start I dismissed the OpenEMR product registration pop-up with \"Ask again later\", without entering anything.\n\nRESULT: DONE patient ID 4 (Viktor Halvorsen)",
